    "d5a09f17-e854-44e3-a7df-aced32db04b0/EventContent": {
      "en": "That day, <主角名称> felt something slip back into their Travel Bag. It was a <Item key=CricketItem str=ColorName/>.<NL>The time that <Character key=MonthlyEvent_arg0 str=Name/>—born of the spirit of <Item key=CricketItem str=ColorName/>—could walk as a human had come to an end,<NL>and so they had returned to their cricket form, coming back to <主角名称>'s side...",
